  "description": {
   "en": "Machiko hated her home and family so much, but one day, when she comes home, a different family is there and everyone has forgotten about her existance...! A touching and spooky horror series about \"homes\".\n\nBegan serialization in the March 1999 issue of Horror M. The first chapter was released as a part of Seikimatsu Kaidan."
